<title>USA: Georgia-Pacific Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Georgia-Pacific Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.99		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 90,000		   50,000</p>
<p> Net sales	    3,145,000		3,053,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  91,000		   90,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: In the 1997 first quarter, the company recorded a gain of $128 million ($80 million after taxes) from the sale of its Martell, Calif., assets to Sierra Pacific Industries.</p>
</text>
